{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform a Barren World into a Thriving Planet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan B: Terraform is a calm and contemplative sci-fi simulation game set in a near future where humanity must look beyond Earth for survival. Your mission: shape a newly discovered planet into a habitable world. Explore a vast, hex-based terrain with over a million tiles and harness a full ecosystem simulation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/548757628123a96e8f7140e37238feec.poster.avif?t=1756796137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/548757628123a96e8f7140e37238feec.webm?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/548757628123a96e8f7140e37238feec.mp4?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Climate, Water, and Life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise global temperatures with greenhouse gas generators, unlock underground ice to form flowing rivers and vast oceans, and restore vegetation across the land. Experience dynamic weather systems, including evaporation, wind patterns, and rainfall. Turn a lifeless rock into a living world covered in forests, rivers, and oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/d994501f6010cd8eeacee7e2fcef414a.poster.avif?t=1756796137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/d994501f6010cd8eeacee7e2fcef414a.webm?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/d994501f6010cd8eeacee7e2fcef414a.mp4?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Supply Chains and Grow Cities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract minerals, manufacture goods, and move them with trucks, trains, drones, and ships. Establish automated supply lines to support expanding cities, transforming small outposts into thriving metropolises with populations in the millions. Every stage of growth depends on your ability to manage logistics, optimize infrastructure, and keep automation running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/76471c8ac575d79ceb03e9edbfa32880.poster.avif?t=1756796137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/76471c8ac575d79ceb03e9edbfa32880.webm?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/76471c8ac575d79ceb03e9edbfa32880.mp4?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/227e18c74683a6744bcad9d436a5aae8.poster.avif?t=1756796137\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/227e18c74683a6744bcad9d436a5aae8.webm?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/extras/227e18c74683a6744bcad9d436a5aae8.mp4?t=1756796137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Extracting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/495cc5b74259d2c76f487bcacb46742ad3a6931c.jpg"},{"name":"Trucks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/15217c5a6a691ca869d06264a9e334d40766d2ec.jpg"},{"name":"I like trains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/5c678c113c65e610d7baa9570e5637ee50a762c8.jpg"},{"name":"Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/56a59b99c3a8233017716dc53a221b306a9fc048.jpg"},{"name":"Life always finds a way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/fa4af321801a2c4a452fff6e94b9d8b3270667de.jpg"},{"name":"Far from home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/d7e66f78b49de3bcd2328abb6bfcd59e358fdd31.jpg"},{"name":"Where are we","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/fbe565d7cd4a2d9eb039b26ab760c42976eb0794.jpg"},{"name":"A better world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/719efc0990b90206d0a7c7c2bf0fbc31a670224a.jpg"},{"name":"I know this one...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/f70b19ad1c2cb3dc9badc2ccda955ee1db337d20.jpg"},{"name":"Repopulating","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1894430/486c08c099d30610644d97bd90c79d00159d1cca.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1894430?t=1756796137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756796137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor